   "subject": "Re: Moderated mediation with latent variables",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">lavaan will complain that <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">cog </span>is not an observed variable and not run the analysis.</p></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Are you sure it is not complaining about genXcog, which is neither observed nor defined as a latent variable?  The lack of a measurement model for genXcog is the only problem I notice in your syntax.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">how can I obtain a general product genXcog that allows me to use in this moderated mediation model?</p></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>You can see example syntax for product-indicators of a latent interaction on one of the &quot;see also&quot; help pages linked at the bottom of <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">?indProd</font>.  </div><div>For example, <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">?probe2WayMC</font>.  In your case,</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">genXcog </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">BDNFord</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">attention </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">EGFRord</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">verbal </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> IL3ord</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">workingm </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span></div></code></div><br><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792426626209000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EuF3dWqDJYWhgw5bMQR3R\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div><div><br></div></div></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div title=\"MDH:RGVhciBUZXJyZW5jZSBhbmQgZmVsbG93IGxhdmFhbmVycyw8YnI+PGJyPjxicj5Tb3JyeSBmb3Ig\r\nYnVtcGluZyB0aGlzIGRpc2N1c3Npb24sIGJ1dCBvbmx5IG5vdyBJIGNvdWxkIHJldHVybiB0byB0\r\naGlzIHByb2JsZW0uPGJyPjxicj48YnI+YGluZFByb2JgIHNlZW1zIHRvIGJlIHdoYXQgSSBuZWVk\r\nIHRvIHNvbHZlIGl0LCBob3dldmVyIEkgbmVlZCBmdXJ0aGVyIGhlbHAgb24gaG93IHRvIHVzZSBp\r\ndC4gRm9yIHRoYXQsIEkgd2lsbCB1c2UgYSBzaW1wbGVyIG1vZGVsIHRoYW4gdGhlIG9uZSBvcmln\r\naW5hbGx5IHBvc3RlZC4gUGxlYXNlIGNvbnNpZGVyIHRoZSBtb2RlbCBzcGVjaWZpY2F0aW9uIGJl\r\nbG93Ojxicj48YnI+YGBgPGJyPm1vZGVsNyAmbHQ7LSDigJw8YnI+wqDCoMKgIHNjaCA9fiBwb3Nf\r\nMmdycCsgbmVnXzJncnArIGRpc18yZ3JwPGJyPsKgwqDCoCBnZW4gPX4gQkRORm9yZCArIEVHRlJv\r\ncmQgKyBJTDNvcmQ8YnI+wqDCoMKgIGNvZyA9fsKgIGF0dGVudGlvbiArIHZlcmJhbCArIHdvcmtp\r\nbmdtPGJyPjxicj7CoMKgwqAgc2NoIH4gY3ByaW1lICogZ2VuPGJyPsKgwqDCoCBzY2ggfiBiICog\r\nY29nPGJyPsKgwqDCoCBzY2ggfiBicHJpbWUgKiBnZW5YY29nPGJyPjxicj7CoMKgwqAgY29nIH4g\r\nYSAqIGdlbjxicj7CoMKgwqAgY29nIH5+IGdlblhj